ass=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1770900039116\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">8. How long does it take to become proficient in Python?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">You can become comfortable with Python basics in two to three months if you practice daily. Reaching a professional level may take six months or more, especially if you work on projects and real-world applications.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1770900051154\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">9. What is the Python course duration for beginners?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">The Python course duration for beginners usually ranges from one to two months. During this time, you learn core concepts, practice coding exercises, and build small projects that help you understand programming fundamentals clearly.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1770900083605\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">10. How much are Python course fees in India?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Python course fees in India usually range from around \u20b98,000 for basic courses to \u20b980,000 or more for advanced and specialized programs, depending on curriculum, trainer experience, certification, and placement support.<\/p> <\/div> <\/div>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/data-analytics-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=BlogBanner&amp;utm_campaign=seo&amp;utm_page=\/python-course-duration-fees\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\" noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1546\" height=\"421\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/da-course-1.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-12830\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/da-course-1.webp 1546w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/da-course-1-300x82.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscub